     3705     excel-sum(bo-Ostatok-end  [6])  CHR(9)
     3706     excel-sum(bo-Ostatok-end  [9])  CHR(9)
     3707     skip.
     3708                End.
     3709      WHEN ""  Then     DO :
     3710       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3711         p3 @ s-bar-code
     3712         p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     3713         p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     3714         p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
     3715         p1 @ gds-type
     3716         ostatok-start [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-ostatok-start
     3717         Prih          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Prih
     3718         RAsh          [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-RAsh
     3719         KAssa         [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-KAssa
     3720         Inv           [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Inv
     3721         Overturn      [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Overturn
     3722         Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3723         gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3724         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3725   if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     3726     p3 CHR(9)
     3727     p4 CHR(9)
     3728     gds-zap-gds-name CHR(9)
     3729     p6 CHR(9)
     3730     gds-zap-type     CHR(9)
     3731     excel-sum(gds-zap-other   )   CHR(9)
     3732     excel-qnty(ostatok-start[1])  CHR(9)
